      "Props can be flat on the section (recommended) or nested under `config` / `props`.",
      "`id` is optional but recommended for stable diffs.",
      "`SECTION_TYPE_MAP` in solid-frontend/src/components/cms/PageRenderer.tsx resolves kebab-case / snake_case / PascalCase / aliases into the 27 registry components."
